<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_875_2477.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diennst</unclear>. sampt was wir
<lb n="2"/>eeren, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear>, unnd guots vermögent zuovor
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">from</unclear> fürsichtig ersam <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Innsonnders</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotten</unclear> fründ, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwenn</unclear> lieben
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eydgnossenn</unclear>. Nachdem
<lb n="6"/>unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besonders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lieber</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitrath</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pannerher</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Andreas</unclear> Schmid</persName>,
<lb n="8"/>von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gott</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> allmechtigen, zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">synen</unclear> gnaden
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berüefft</unclear>. Unnd wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">annderer</unclear> unnserer
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obligenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschaefften</unclear> halb, nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glych</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angentz</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>einen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anndern</unclear>, an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stat</unclear> zuo einem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pan</unclear>-
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nerheren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erwellt</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genomen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Soll</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>der unnser <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Guntpper</unclear></persName> von <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kussen</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">am</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">see</unclear> zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zürychsee</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesessen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Küßnach</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> daselbs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelegen</unclear>, in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bysin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlicher</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erennpersonen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßhalben</unclear> etwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">worten</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußgestossen</unclear> haben, so unns gar beschwerlich
<lb n="18"/>unnd nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogedulden</unclear>. Unnd so dann üwer
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rathßfründ</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">amptman</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sannt</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Cathryna</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>closters</persName>, <persName resp="#ner">Niclaus <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jäger</unclear></persName>, wie unns anlangt
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> by <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußgestossnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">red</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewesen</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear>, darvon etwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüssens</unclear> haben soll, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>unns daran etwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelegen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> will. So
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lanngt</unclear> an üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ganntz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">flyßig</unclear> pitt, ir wellent den
<lb n="26"/>selben üwern lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitrath</unclear>, Niclaus
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jägern</unclear>, by <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">synen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rathßpflichten</unclear> (oder wie
<lb n="28"/>es by üch nach form <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rechtens</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">brüchig</unclear>) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umb</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obvermelte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hanndlung</unclear>, was er von <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jacoben</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Guntpper</unclear></persName>, von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwellung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">panner</unclear>-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_875_2478.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mightens</unclear> wegen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstanden</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kundtschaffts</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear> verhoeren, unnd was ir by inen
<lb n="33"/>befinden, unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sag</unclear> inn schrifft by
<lb n="34"/>diserem unnserem darumb gsanndten
<lb n="35"/>loeuﬀers botten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoschicken</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerer</unclear> dar-
<lb n="36"/>inne nach der gepuer zehanndlen wuessen.
<lb n="37"/>Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stat</unclear> unns umb üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guottwillig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverdienen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dath</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><origDate when="1565" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sambstags den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">14</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear> julij. anno etc. 65</origDate>.
<lb n="40"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rath
<lb n="41"/>der statt Zürich</orgName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_875_2479.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_875_2480.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="42"/>Den fromen, fürsichtigen, ersamen
<lb n="43"/>unnd wysen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ratt</unclear> der Statt Sannt Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="45"/>unnsern insonnders guotten frün-
<lb n="46"/>den unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben
<lb n="47"/>eydtgnossen.
</p>
